<title>PORTUGAL: Bourse delays re-start of Banco Pinto.</title>
<headline>Bourse delays re-start of Banco Pinto.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lisbon bourse was forced to delay again the re-start of trading in Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor after attempts to find an equilibrium price failed, traders said.</p>
<p>The so-called &quot;auction phase&quot; which precedes the re-start of trade after a stock has been suspended for excessive price moves was halted after 14 minutes, they said.</p>
<p>It was not known when the stock would be re-admitted.</p>
</text>
